  "hitRate": {
    "_": "Morrowind rolls to hit and a miss awards no skill progress. At a class-start weapon skill with middling Agility/Luck, roughly three swings in five connect; enemies fare slightly worse against a moving player. Argonia has no such roll (Souls combat: you hit what you swing at), which is why its content file omits this block and defaults to 1.0. Applied to the fight simulator's real swing counts, not to its outcomes - it changes what you LEARN from a fight, never who wins it.",
    "player": 0.62,
    "enemy": 0.55
  },
